WEBVTT

00:07:01.836 --> 00:07:03.956
We don't see such a dramatic orgasm gap

00:07:03.996 --> 00:07:07.156
when LGBTQ+ people
have sex with each other.

00:07:07.156 --> 00:07:09.996
So, for example, women
having sex with women

00:07:09.996 --> 00:07:13.476
can expect an orgasm rate
only slightly less

00:07:13.476 --> 00:07:15.316
than when they're on their own.

00:07:16.236 --> 00:07:19.276
This data is important

00:07:19.316 --> 00:07:22.396
because it tells us that it's gender

00:07:22.396 --> 00:07:25.916
which is responsible for inequality
in the experience of orgasms.

00:07:26.436 --> 00:07:30.756
Not anatomy, not capacity for pleasure,